 470:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/mem.c ****  * This assumes access to the heap is protected by the calling function
 471:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/mem.c ****  * already.
 472:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/mem.c ****  */
